hese challenges are not just questions of scale and scaffolding; they require revisiting fundamental design choices. To build truly autonomous AI scientists, we recommend scientific simulations as verifiers for training, a persistent, mutable epistemic state that carries beliefs and shifting objectives across an investigation, the establishment of a centralized preregistration repository for all AI-generated hypotheses, and application driven by scientific need rather than tool affordance."}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W7202085622", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.51847/aolckzpo1a", "title": "Agentic Drug Discovery Requires a Scientific Constitution for Autonomous Planning, Tool Selection, Experimentation, and Human Intervention", "publication_year": 2025, "type": "article", "cited_by_count": 0, "open_access": {"is_oa": true, "oa_status": "hybrid", "oa_url": "https://pharmacophorejournal.com/storage/files/article/f83a2b72-870c-4f27-9261-c4f9af86f981-BeA5zvDxvqd7AJew/o2OHIH4A0SVnHdJ.pdf", "any_repository_has_fulltext": false}, "primary_location": {"id": "doi:10.51847/aolckzpo1a", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.51847/aolckzpo1a", "is_oa": true, "landing_page_url": "https://doi.org/10.51847/aolckzpo1a", "pdf_url": "https://pharmacophorejournal.com/storage/files/article/f83a2b72-870c-4f27-9261-c4f9af86f981-BeA5zvDxvqd7AJew/o2OHIH4A0SVnHdJ.pdf", "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4210195344", "display_name": "Pharmacophore", "issn_l": "2229-5402", "issn": ["2229-5402"], "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": ["norway-1", "poland-20", "russia-white-list-3"], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": "cc-by-nc-sa", "license_id": "https://openalex.org/licenses/cc-by-nc-sa", "version": "publishedVersion", "is_accepted": true, "is_published": true, "raw_source_name": "Pharmacophore", "raw_type": "journal-article"}, "abstract": "Art